nd then there's  the fact that it doesn't seem to have  applied to social care in terms of the  policy we've heard about today the  social care sector offers vital support  to the NHS one and a half million people  work in this area and 17% of them are  from overseas and there is no detail on  how they will access the UK in few  under a points-based system the NHS  already struggles to fill vacant posts  so anything that makes it easier to  recruit will be welcomed  but imposing barriers on EU Nationals  for the first time is a significant  concern and there's simply not enough  detail about the wider system to judge  whether this policy will ultimately help  or hinder
 

